  "label": "Anti-Asian Racism",
  "description": "Discrimination and prejudice against Asian people, often rooted in stereotypes such as the 'foreign infiltrator' trope. This trope is frequently used to attack Asian individuals in positions of power, suggesting they are not truly loyal to their adopted country. The meme implicitly draws from this by using the 'enemy within' accusation, which has historically been used against Asian Americans.",
